Scope and upstream acknowledgement

The MIT License above covers the code written for this project:
`skills/`, `mcp/dy_mcp/`, `mcp/tests/`, `mcp/utils/data_util.py`,
`mcp/mcp_server.py`, `mcp/douyin_cli.py` and the documentation.

The Douyin signing and API modules under `mcp/builder/`, `mcp/dy_apis/` and
`mcp/utils/` (except `data_util.py`) are derived from DouYin_Spider by cv-cat
and its contributors (https://github.com/cv-cat/DouYin_Spider), trimmed down to
credentials, creator analytics, search, download and video publishing. Thanks to the upstream
authors for their work. The upstream repository does not ship a license file
and states that it is provided for learning and technical research only; those
derived files remain subject to the upstream project's terms, and you should
check them before redistributing or using this code commercially.

This project is not affiliated with Douyin or ByteDance. Use it only with your
own account, and follow the platform's terms of service and applicable laws.
